<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34172" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμμισθος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in receipt of pay,
			hired</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					816e
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. τινος</span>
			<i>paid for</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
				13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. τινα ποιεῖν</span> to make
			him <i>pensionary</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖδας ὀρφανούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					71
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅλην τὴν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Per.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of work,
				<i>paid</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργάνων καὶ ἔργων
				γένεσις ἔ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				920e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>mercenary</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ ἔ. ἡ θεραπεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
